{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate a futuristic control hub</strong> filled with switches, sliders, and strange tasks.<br>Complete fast-paced challenges to satisfy <strong>The Board</strong>, the corporate entity overseeing your progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/dd7259c226a5bd52b451bf4f7c9c5541.poster.avif?t=1772721851\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/dd7259c226a5bd52b451bf4f7c9c5541.webm?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/dd7259c226a5bd52b451bf4f7c9c5541.mp4?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every task is a micro-challenge:</strong> click, drag, flip, shoot, slide\u2026<br>Easy to learn and instantly satisfying.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/39b37bdc2ab5486bc31be19847e37243.poster.avif?t=1772721851\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/39b37bdc2ab5486bc31be19847e37243.webm?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/39b37bdc2ab5486bc31be19847e37243.mp4?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and frantic sessions.</strong> Complete tasks to trigger a <strong>Neuron Activation</strong>, resetting the board while boosting your score with multipliers and extra score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/867a522576b630ffbc7caa43c07cab66.poster.avif?t=1772721851\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/867a522576b630ffbc7caa43c07cab66.webm?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/867a522576b630ffbc7caa43c07cab66.mp4?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your multitasking.</strong> Juggle several tasks at once to maximize your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c92ad9dd046b3ab6a0621ef2461facd9.poster.avif?t=1772721851\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c92ad9dd046b3ab6a0621ef2461facd9.webm?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c92ad9dd046b3ab6a0621ef2461facd9.mp4?t=1772721851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+</strong> handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens</strong> of different tasks to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different gameplay stages</strong>, such as Speed Tests and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zen Mode</strong> \u2013 enjoy the pure satisfaction of tasks without timers or scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fourth-wall breaking narrative</strong> full of surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player customization and leveling system</strong></p></li>